blocks keep a single newline between blocks","A doc with a split code_block saves byte-identically to the same doc with a single text node","Regression tests cover split mid-line, split inside a string literal, and existing single-node/multi-block cases"],"context_refs":["backlog-devtoday-code.md \u2014 Filed by new-issue-creator (2026-10-25 20:15 CDT run)","hidden_files/issue-code-id-web-raw-text-split-body.md","code #882 (markdown-path multi-node code_block fix, the precedent)"],"max_attempts":2,"priority_reason":"Verified save-path data corruption (phantom newlines in code/config files) with a narrow, precedent-backed fix (#882) and a targeted test path","timebox_minutes":45}', 'done', 40, 'repo-health:v1:fix:developing-today/code:issue:932', '2026-10-26 01:22:33.988888+00', '2026-10-26 16:38:01.615582+00') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET queue=excluded.queue, title=excluded.title, payload=excluded.payload, status=excluded.status, priority=excluded.priority, dedupe_key=excluded.dedupe_key, updated_at=excluded.updated_at;
INSERT INTO coord_tasks (id, queue, title, payload, status, priority, dedupe_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1084, 'repo-health-code-pilot', 'Small fix #934: format_unix_timestamp unbounded year loop', '{"set":null,"kind":"small_fix","repo":"developing-today/code","risk":{"flags":[],"level":"low"},"issue":{"url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/934","title":"id(web): format_unix_timestamp loops year-by-year from 1970 with no range check \u2014 a huge modified/archive timestamp hangs every file-list render","number":934,"state_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:33:00Z"},"scope":{"exclude":["cross-repo implementation","held/Drew-owned PRs","secrets, credentials, purchases, or Drew-only decisions","parse_iso_timestamp (already hardened under #756)"],"include":["pkgs/id/src/web/templates.rs format_unix_timestamp and its call site, plus tests"]},"tests":["cargo test --features web --lib web::templates (run on CI or laptop; no sandbox build)"],"dedupe":{"basis":"gh search issues for format_unix_timestamp and timestamp-hang/file-list-render returned no matches; issue number is the work identity","checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:33:00Z"},"schema":"repo-task/v1","problem":"Rendering a file list loops year-by-year for unvalidated tag timestamps; a huge value hangs every render persistently.","evidence":["pkgs/id/src/web/templates.rs:915-971 on main 402b5aa1: year loop from 1970, one iteration per year, no range check; sole caller templates.rs:294-296 display_ts = modified_at.or(created_at).or(timestamp)","pkgs/id/src/web/routes.rs:781-796: created/modified tag values accepted via bare s.parse::<u64>(); routes.rs:150-168 classify_tag: x.archive.18446744073709551615 yields timestamp u64::MAX","Optimized (rustc -O) replication of the loop: ts=1711000000 instant (54 iterations), ts=1e15 finished in 33ms (3.17e7 iterations), ts=1e17 did not finish before a 30s timeout; u64::MAX extrapolates to ~5.8e11 iterations"],"acceptance":["Out-of-range timestamps never trigger a year