"clippy-lint (nix flake check clippy-lint job, or cargo clippy with the crate''s deny set) passes with the change","test_misplaced_nodes_return_error_not_panic still fails if a case stops returning MisplacedNode (assert strength unchanged, message still names the case and the actual result)","Diff confined to test code in pkgs/id/src/web/markdown.rs (or a scoped allow attribute on that one test)"],"context_refs":["https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/1245","https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/1044","pkgs/id/src/web/markdown.rs:1999"],"max_attempts":2,"priority_reason":"Blocks every PR branched from current main (already blocking #1193/#1044 and #1238/#1228); one-line test fix.","timebox_minutes":45}', 'cancelled', 30, 'repo-health:v1:fix:developing-today/code:issue:1245', '2026-10-27 04:19:13.741445+00', '2026-10-27 09:59:28.29162+00') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET queue=excluded.queue, title=excluded.title, payload=excluded.payload, status=excluded.status, priority=excluded.priority, dedupe_key=excluded.dedupe_key, updated_at=excluded.updated_at;
