'Mon'',9] -> [1,2,5]"],"acceptance":["toggleWeekday over daysOfWeek [''Mon'',''fri'',9] no longer silently removes any stored entry: unmapped entries are preserved verbatim in the result","Editor reads OpenCode-valid day forms: ''Mon'' -> 1, ''5'' -> 5, '' fri '' -> 5 (case-insensitive, trimmed, numeric strings)","Regression tests cover the mixed-list toggle and the valid-form mapping; the pinned dropping test at routeSchedules.test.ts:17 is updated to the new contract","Existing routeSchedules tests pass (bun test packages/ui/src/lib/routing/routeSchedules.test.ts)"],"context_refs":["https://github.com/developing-today/openchamber/issues/514"],"max_attempts":2,"priority_reason":"Silent data loss on save for runtime-valid configs; bounded two-function fix with clear tests. Normal priority.","timebox_minutes":45}', 'done', 30, 'repo-health:v1:fix:developing-today/openchamber:issue:514', '2026-10-27 11:02:01.633829+00', '2026-10-27 15:27:34.557547+00') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET queue=excluded.queue, title=excluded.title, payload=excluded.payload, status=excluded.status, priority=excluded.priority, dedupe_key=excluded.dedupe_key, updated_at=excluded.updated_at;
